 test-ctx  https://gateway.example/clus.../path  ... (file)

  +------------------------------------------------------+
  |                                                      |
  |  Export db-creds/DB_PASSWORD to a file               |
  |  --------------------------------------------------  |
  |                                                      |
  |  export Secret default/db-creds - key DB_PASSWORD    |
  |  context test-ctx                                    |
  |  server https://gateway.example/clusters/production  |
  |  /a/very/long/apiserver/path                         |
  |                                                      |
  |  in .                                                |
  |                                                      |
  |  ! This writes the plaintext secret to disk. sk64    |
  |    never removes it.                                 |
  |                                                      |
  |  > configs                                           |
  |    notes.txt                                         |
  |    values.yaml                                       |
  |                                                      |
  +------------------------------------------------------+

